## 🔌 API Reference (For Developers)

### Content Script API
```javascript
// Access the scraper API from any script
window.hyperScraperAPI.scrape({
  mode: 'auto', // 'table', 'list', 'products', 'custom'
  selectors: ['.product-item'], // Required for custom mode
  includeImages: true,
  maxRows: 1000
});